{"story":{"id":"anomaly-distar-clone-cat","title":{"zh":"可疑的舱体","en":"Murky Vats"},"category":"exploration","kind":"anomaly","image":"art/16380ac8a27a3cc66897.webp","start":"anomalies:DISTAR_CLONE_CAT","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"对废弃的环形世界[From.GetName]的初步成像显示出在某些毁坏的区段上有着大量完好无损的舱体。这些舱体里装载的东西未知是什么。","en":"Initial imaging of the ruined [From.GetName] ring world indicates a number of intact vats located on some of the dilapidated sections. Whatever these vats might hold is unknown."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"anomalies:DISTAR_CLONE_CAT","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"distar.70","parent":"n1","via":{"chance":1.0,"group":"r29391","hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:215"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"special_projects:CRYO_CLONES_PROJECT","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"distar.70.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:2841"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"distar.71","parent":"n3","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:162"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"anomalies:DISTAR_CLONE_CAT","kind":"anomaly","title":{"zh":"可疑的舱体","en":"Murky Vats"},"texts":[{"zh":"对废弃的环形世界[From.GetName]的初步成像显示出在某些毁坏的区段上有着大量完好无损的舱体。这些舱体里装载的东西未知是什么。","en":"Initial imaging of the ruined [From.GetName] ring world indicates a number of intact vats located on some of the dilapidated sections. Whatever these vats might hold is unknown."}],"sections":[{"zh":"对废弃的环形世界[From.GetName]的初步成像显示出在某些毁坏的区段上有着大量完好无损的舱体。这些舱体里装载的东西未知是什么。","en":"Initial imaging of the ruined [From.GetName] ring world indicates a number of intact vats located on some of the dilapidated sections. Whatever these vats might hold is unknown."}],"image":"art/16380ac8a27a3cc66897.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.70","kind":"research","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"research","chance":1.0,"group":"r29391","source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:215","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-distar-clone-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt","line":205}},{"id":"distar.70","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷仓中的克隆体","en":"Clones in Cryostasis"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[From.GetName]环形世界损坏的储存区深处，这些阴暗的舱体里面存放着数以千计处于冷冻状态的外星生物。有些仍然存活，但大部分似乎都遭遇了冷冻设备故障，已经化为一滩摊腐朽程度不同的污泥。\n\n令人吃惊的是，所有的外星生物完全一样：分析显示他们都是基因克隆的产物。科学专员[Root.GetLeaderName]称我们可以将还活着的克隆体解冻。不过他们所处的环形世界目前已无法支持生命，我们必须得给他们提供一个住处。","en":"The murky vats located deep in the ruined storage sections of [From.GetName] ring world contain thousands of alien creatures in cryostasis. Some are still living, while many thousands more appear to have suffered cryochamber malfunctions, leaving them as organic sludge in varying stages of decomposition.\n\nRemarkably, all of the aliens are completely identical: analysis of their remains reveals them to be genetic clones. Science Officer [Root.GetLeaderName] suggests we could attempt to thaw out the living clones - though as their ring world is currently without life-support, we would have to give them some place to live."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d154df6317c4085c5516.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.70.a","label":{"zh":"这真让人兴奋，赶紧将他们解冻。","en":"Thaw them out. This is exciting."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:CRYO_CLONES_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:2841","story":"anomaly-distar-clone-cat"},{"target":"distar.9000","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","chance":0.3,"group":"c5502","delay":[{"days":"10"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"has_distar","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"encountered_f