"kind":"project","title":{"zh":"环形世界冷冻克隆人","en":"Cryonic Ring World Clones"},"texts":[{"zh":"环绕[From.GetName]的环形世界上的冷冻舱内，有着数百个仍然存活的冷冻克隆人。与其让他们像同类一样慢慢死亡，我们的生物学家提议解冻他们。","en":"There are hundreds of still-living clones sealed in cryostasis chambers on the ruined Ring World surrounding [From.GetName]. Rather than let them slowly die off like many of their comrades, our biologists propose thawing them out."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/8d5475edf8f6f84b714c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.71","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:162","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-distar-clone-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt","line":146}},{"id":"distar.71","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷冻克隆体已复苏","en":"Cryonic Clones Revived"},"texts":[{"zh":"科学专员[Root.GetLeaderName]高兴地汇报称除了少数无法挽救的个体，对冷冻克隆人的复活取得圆满成功，这些克隆人性情温顺，看上去对自己被创造后的世界毫无了解。[Root.GetLeaderName]猜测他们被建造[From.GetStarName]环形世界的物种当做劳工使用。\n\n虽然这些克隆体愿意服从命令，[Root.GetLeaderName]指出对克隆体的神经共振扫描数据表明他们不擅长应付复杂的工作。","en":"Science Officer [Root.GetLeaderName] is pleased to report that barring a small number of unsalvageable cases, the revival of the derelict ring world clones from cryostasis has been a success. The clones are quite docile individuals, who appear to know nothing of the circumstances behind their creation. [Root.GetLeaderName] speculates that they were used as laborers by whatever ancient civilization constructed the [From.GetStarName] ring world.\n\nThe clones appear to be willing to follow orders, though [Root.GetLeaderName] cautions that preliminary neuro-resonance scanning suggests they are not the best equipped to deal with complex tasks."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d154df6317c4085c5516.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.71.pop.default","label":{"zh":"让克隆体为我们进行工作。","en":"Assign them to our workforce."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"[pop_planet.GetName]上获得200£pop£冷冻克隆人口。","en":"Gain 200 £pop£ Cryonic Clone Pops on [pop_planet.GetName]."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":false,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_xenophile","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端亲外主义","en":"Fanatic Xenophile"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":false,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"slavery_allowed","scope":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"distar.71.no_room","label":{"zh":"我们星球上没有空间供他们居住，准备一艘船吧。","en":"We have no room for them planetside. Prepare a ship."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"any_owned_planet","arg":"{…}","scope":"owner","value":false}]],"sets":["got_cryonic_clone_colonizer"]},{"key":"distar.71.pop.phile","label":{"zh":"我们应该热烈欢迎他们！","en":"We welcome them with open arms!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"[pop_planet.GetName]上获得200£pop£冷冻克隆人口。","en":"Gain 200 £pop£ Cryonic Clone Pops on [pop_planet.GetName]."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":true,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_xenophile","value":true,"label":{"zh":"极端亲外主义","en":"Fanatic Xenophile"}}]]},{"key":"distar.71.pop.slave","label":{"zh":"拿他们做奴隶正合适。","en":"They should make useful slaves."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"[pop_planet.GetName]上获得200£pop£冷冻克隆人口。","en":"Gain 200 £pop£ Cryonic Clone Pops on [pop_planet.GetName]."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"slavery_allowed","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"key":"distar.71.pop.swarm","label":{"zh":"他们将作为有益健康的食材为[Root.Owner.GetSpeciesSpawnNamePlural]作出贡献。","en":"They will make healthy fodder for our [Root.Owner.GetSpeciesSpawnNamePlural]."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"将克隆体加工为营养物质。","en":"Process the clones into nutrients."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"key":"distar.71.pop.servi","label":{"zh":"他们再也不用工作了。","en":"They need not work anymore."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"[pop_planet.GetName]上获得200£pop£冷冻克隆人口。","en":"Gain 200 £pop£ Cryonic Clone Pops on [pop_planet.GetName]."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_servitor","value":true,"label":{"zh":"失控机仆","en":"Rogue Servitor"}}]]},{"key":"distar.71.pop.assim","label":{"zh":"他们将被同化。","en":"They will be assimilated."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"[pop_planet.GetName]上获得200£pop£冷冻克隆人口。","en":"Gain 200 £pop£ Cryonic Clone Pops on [pop_planet.GetName]."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_assimilator","value":true,"label":{"zh":"同化斗士","en":"Driven Assimilator"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":2928},"names":{"pop_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"},"Root.GetLeaderName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"},"From.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}}}]}